{"nodes": [{"id": "_github_workflows_desplegar_desplegar", "label": "Workflow: Desplegar", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L16-L28", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La GitHub App de Render nunca se instal\u00f3 sobre a-sebs/Saldus (solo est\u00e1 autorizada), as\u00ed que su Auto-Deploy On Commit queda guardado y no se dispara jam\u00e1s. En vez de pelear con esa integraci\u00f3n, el workflow avisa a Render llamando al Deploy Hook. Se dispara solo en push a develop con cambios en web/**, render.yaml o el propio workflow, y tambi\u00e9n a mano (workflow_dispatch)."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_desplegar_verificar_y_desplegar", "label": "Job: verificar-y-desplegar", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L31-L71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Corre en ubuntu-latest con Node 24 y working-directory web: npm ci, npm run typecheck, npm test, npm run build, y solo entonces curl POST al hook. El env HOOK se declara a nivel de job y no de paso porque el env de un paso todav\u00eda no existe cuando se eval\u00faa el if de ese mismo paso."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_desplegar_render_deploy_hook", "label": "Secreto RENDER_DEPLOY_HOOK", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L13-L14,L35-L36,L64-L71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "URL que aparece en Render \u2192 saldus \u2192 Settings \u2192 Deploy \u2192 Deploy Hook. El paso de aviso lleva if env.HOOK != '' para que un push de alguien sin acceso al secreto no falle con un error confuso: en su lugar se emite un ::warning:: y no se despliega nada."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_desplegar_filtro_de_rutas", "label": "Filtro de rutas del disparador (web/**, render.yaml, workflow)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L21-L26", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mismo criterio que el rootDir de Render: cambiar solo documentaci\u00f3n no justifica un despliegue."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_desplegar_verificar_antes_de_desplegar", "label": "Verificar (tipos, pruebas, build) antes de desplegar", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L9-L11,L53-L60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Queda mejor que el auto-deploy de Render: primero se comprueba que el proyecto compila y que las pruebas pasan, y solo entonces se despliega. Render, por su cuenta, publicar\u00eda igual una rama rota."}], "edges": [{"source": "_github_workflows_desplegar_desplegar", "target": "_github_workflows_desplegar_verificar_y_desplegar", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L30-L31", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_desplegar_verificar_y_desplegar", "target": "_github_workflows_desplegar_render_deploy_hook", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L35-L36,L64-L66", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_desplegar_verificar_antes_de_desplegar", "target": "_github_workflows_desplegar_verificar_y_desplegar", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L9-L11", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_desplegar_filtro_de_rutas", "target": "_github_workflows_desplegar_desplegar", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L21-L26", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_desplegar_filtro_de_rutas", "target": "render_saldus", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L21-L22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_desplegar_render_deploy_hook", "target": "render_saldus", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L13-L14", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_desplegar_desplegar", "target": "render_autodeploy", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L3-L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_desplegar_verificar_y_desplegar", "target": "render_node_version", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L44-L46", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_desplegar_verificar_y_desplegar", "target": "readme_comandos", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml", "source_location": "L50-L60", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "flujo_de_despliegue_frontend", "label": "Flujo de despliegue del frontend (GitHub Actions \u2192 Deploy Hook \u2192 Render static site)", "nodes": ["_github_workflows_desplegar_desplegar", "_github_workflows_desplegar_render_deploy_hook", "_github_workflows_desplegar_verificar_antes_de_desplegar", "render_saldus", "render_autodeploy", "readme_despliegue_render"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/desplegar.yml"}]}